WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:30.010 --> 01:31.150
[My Journey to You]

01:31.180 --> 01:34.030
[Episode 14]

01:34.720 --> 01:35.720
Tell me.

01:37.650 --> 01:38.940
Whose blood is this?

01:52.539 --> 01:53.259
Young Master Shangjue.

01:53.259 --> 01:54.460
This is what we found.

01:56.620 --> 01:57.900
On the shoe soles, there's blood

01:57.900 --> 01:59.560
and some shards of porcelain.

02:09.160 --> 02:11.330
[Lasting Prosperity]

02:10.289 --> 02:12.340
Shangguan Qian is Anonymous.

02:15.260 --> 02:17.490
Why did she attack Lady Wuji?

02:17.950 --> 02:19.110
Her target

02:19.980 --> 02:20.910
is not Lady Wuji,

02:22.110 --> 02:22.780
but me.

02:24.780 --> 02:25.780
Young Master Ziyu

02:25.840 --> 02:28.150
just happened to have sneaked out of the Gong residence at night

02:28.150 --> 02:30.930
and Lady Wuji happened to have come to look for Young Master Ziyu.

02:30.930 --> 02:31.530
That's why

02:31.980 --> 02:33.440
Lady Wuji was implicated.

02:33.800 --> 02:35.660
Lady Wuji treats me as her family.

02:35.810 --> 02:38.900
I'm suffering more than anyone from her bloody disaster.

02:38.900 --> 02:41.630
Shangguan Qian is a member of your Jue residence.

02:41.970 --> 02:43.430
You have to take the blame.

02:44.690 --> 02:46.350
I was negligent in management

02:46.579 --> 02:47.550
and gave the villain

02:47.550 --> 02:48.530
a chance to kill.

02:49.480 --> 02:50.680
I should be punished.

02:52.040 --> 02:53.190
But you

02:53.770 --> 02:55.820
ignored the rules of the Gong residence

02:55.820 --> 02:58.370
and left the Gong residence with Yun Weishan without permission.

02:58.370 --> 02:59.900
How should you be punished?

03:01.060 --> 03:02.990
My negligence was unintentional,

03:03.250 --> 03:05.380
but you knowingly violated the rules.

03:05.640 --> 03:08.060
You knew that once you became the Sword Wielder,

03:08.060 --> 03:09.950
you can't leave the Gong residence.

03:09.950 --> 03:12.130
The rule is that I can't leave Jiuchen Valley.

03:12.130 --> 03:14.170
Don't subtly try to change the concept.

03:14.170 --> 03:15.370
As the Sword Wielder,

03:16.220 --> 03:17.480
I think I have the right

03:17.530 --> 03:18.670
to take my wife out.

03:19.970 --> 03:22.030
When my father was the Sword Wielder,

03:22.180 --> 03:23.579
he took my mother out to look at the festive lanterns.

03:23.579 --> 03:25.510
Your father was the Sword Wielder,

03:25.650 --> 03:28.050
so he had the right to take his wife on a trip.

03:29.040 --> 03:32.040
But you didn't even pass the Trial of the Three Realms.

03:32.270 --> 03:34.850
How dare you call yourself the Sword Wielder?

03:35.570 --> 03:38.430
And you and Yun Weishan are not officially married.

03:38.670 --> 03:40.079
How is she your wife?

03:40.480 --> 03:41.750
It's only a matter of time before I become the Sword Wielder.

03:41.750 --> 03:42.210
Enough.

03:46.730 --> 03:49.360
Now that you're in the position of the Sword Wielder,

03:49.360 --> 03:52.670
you should know the rules that the Sword Wielder has to abide by.

03:52.670 --> 03:53.950
You took Yun Weishan out of the Gong residence

03:53.950 --> 03:56.110
without asking the Council of Elders for permission.

03:56.110 --> 03:57.970
And you're still making excuses.

03:57.980 --> 03:59.780
I'm really disappointed in you.

04:01.300 --> 04:02.560
If you break the rules,

04:02.680 --> 04:04.010
you should be punished.

04:04.490 --> 04:06.350
Even if you're the Sword Wielder.

04:06.440 --> 04:07.040
Later,

04:07.200 --> 04:09.700
please go to the Council of Elders Hall's confinement room

04:09.700 --> 04:11.360
and reflect on your mistakes.

04:12.940 --> 04:15.430
Now is not the time to evaluate the right and wrong

04:15.430 --> 04:17.230
of the Sword Wielder's actions.

04:17.260 --> 04:18.860
The most important thing now

04:19.510 --> 04:21.240
is to confirm if Shangguan Qian

04:21.910 --> 04:22.960
is Anonymous.

04:24.650 --> 04:25.980
She's indeed a suspect.

04:26.810 --> 04:28.240
We need to interrogate her properly

04:28.240 --> 04:29.500
in order to confirm it.

04:30.150 --> 04:31.350
Elder Yue was killed.

04:32.590 --> 04:34.909
The Jue residence promises to find out who Anonymous is.

04:34.909 --> 04:36.040
During this period,

04:36.659 --> 04:40.320
I've been suspecting that the killer was inside the Yu residence.

04:40.580 --> 04:41.380
But now,

04:42.480 --> 04:45.060
the suspect actually appeared in the Jue residence.

04:45.060 --> 04:45.540
And

04:45.540 --> 04:46.580
it's even the future bride

04:46.580 --> 04:49.040
selected by Young Master Shangjue himself.

04:49.960 --> 04:50.820
Gong Shangjue.

04:51.140 --> 04:52.409
Don't you have anything to say?

04:52.409 --> 04:55.070
Shangguan Qian has been detained in the prison.

04:55.340 --> 04:57.800
Naturally, I'll interrogate her properly.

04:58.800 --> 05:00.810
Also, you previously suspected Lady Wuji.

05:00.810 --> 05:02.210
Now, her life is at stake.

05:02.270 --> 05:03.790
Shouldn't you apologize for that?

05:03.790 --> 05:05.930
It's still too early to apologize.

05:07.100 --> 05:07.960
Shangguan Qian

05:08.740 --> 05:10.150
might not be Anonymous.

05:10.350 --> 05:12.240
We have solid evidence and a witness.

05:12.240 --> 05:13.900
You still want to protect her?

05:15.230 --> 05:15.830
Shangjue.

05:17.260 --> 05:18.140
Did you

05:18.540 --> 05:19.940
notice another problem?

05:23.410 --> 05:25.670
There are two things that I'm puzzled by.

05:26.040 --> 05:26.570
Firstly,

05:27.360 --> 05:30.300
the blood left by Anonymous on the screen in Gong Ziyu's room

05:30.300 --> 05:31.480
this time

05:31.860 --> 05:33.520
was obviously left in a hurry.

05:33.610 --> 05:34.220
She left

05:34.220 --> 05:36.280
before the last stroke was finished.

05:36.760 --> 05:38.650
And from the time I entered the Yu residence

05:38.650 --> 05:40.780
to the time I entered Gong Ziyu's room,

05:41.220 --> 05:43.350
there were no suspicious figures

05:44.250 --> 05:45.990
or unusual noises.

05:47.110 --> 05:48.320
The person was able

05:48.720 --> 05:50.120
to escape without a trace

05:50.370 --> 05:51.430
in my presence.

05:52.140 --> 05:53.320
There are few people

05:54.310 --> 05:55.400
in the world

05:55.990 --> 05:57.990
who possess such Lightness skills.

05:58.570 --> 05:59.440
Shangguan Qian

06:00.040 --> 06:02.380
doesn't have such great Lightness skills.

06:02.380 --> 06:05.240
So she's not the person who wrote the words in blood.

06:06.820 --> 06:08.480
Then are you saying the killer

06:08.890 --> 06:10.490
can disappear into thin air?

06:11.700 --> 06:13.560
The one who left the words in blood

06:13.950 --> 06:16.080
either has superior Lightness skills

06:16.410 --> 06:16.950
or

06:18.620 --> 06:20.080
she didn't leave the room.

06:20.470 --> 06:21.600
That's ridiculous.

06:22.300 --> 06:23.630
You were the one who said

06:24.090 --> 06:26.420
that only you and Lady Wuji were in my room.

06:27.120 --> 06:28.270
Are you pointing out

06:28.780 --> 06:30.110
that you are Anonymous?

06:33.600 --> 06:35.330
Do you still suspect Lady Wuji?

06:35.850 --> 06:36.980
This is ridiculous.

06:37.590 --> 06:38.920
Young Master Shangjue.

06:40.100 --> 06:42.230
I really want to agree with your guess.

06:43.820 --> 06:45.960
But I checked Lady Wuji's wound.

06:47.220 --> 06:48.620
Her wound was on her back.

06:49.050 --> 06:50.850
The cut was extremely accurate.

06:51.770 --> 06:52.880
Someone must have

06:53.270 --> 06:55.070
secretly attacked her from behind.

06:55.070 --> 06:56.680
The sword was stabbed in with one thrust.

06:56.680 --> 06:58.810
It couldn't have been done by oneself.

07:00.220 --> 07:02.030
Lady Wuji's wound is very deep

07:02.750 --> 07:03.790
and narrow.

07:05.220 --> 07:05.860
It means

07:06.800 --> 07:09.460
that the killer used a thin and resilient sword.

07:10.750 --> 07:13.230
It's a weapon that's commonly used by Wufeng.

07:13.230 --> 07:13.870
Wrong.

07:15.400 --> 07:18.200
There was only a soft sword with blood in the scene.

07:19.290 --> 07:21.420
This soft sword was hidden in the belt.

07:21.700 --> 07:22.590
This belt

07:22.820 --> 07:24.360
belongs to Lady Wuji.

07:25.300 --> 07:26.760
Isn't that even stranger?

07:27.570 --> 07:28.430
Lady Wuji

07:29.070 --> 07:30.870
stabbed herself with her sword?

07:32.220 --> 07:33.480
Elder Yue, be patient.

07:34.620 --> 07:36.080
The second puzzling point

07:36.370 --> 07:37.370
is even stranger.

07:38.360 --> 07:39.820
Everyone should remember

07:40.050 --> 07:42.380
that when the former Elder Yue was killed,

07:43.070 --> 07:44.000
the Meeting Hall

07:44.490 --> 07:45.640
was neat and clean

07:46.170 --> 07:47.770
and everything was in place.

07:48.550 --> 07:50.480
With Elder Yue's superior skills,

07:50.720 --> 07:52.740
the fact that she killed him in one move

07:52.740 --> 07:55.000
shows that Anonymous is highly skilled.

07:56.510 --> 07:59.150
However, when Lady Wuji, who has ordinary martial arts skills,

07:59.150 --> 08:00.210
was assassinated,

08:00.550 --> 08:03.210
the room became a huge mess because of the fight.

08:04.860 --> 08:05.980
If Shangguan Qian

08:06.120 --> 08:08.520
had such a hard time dealing with Lady Wuji,

08:09.620 --> 08:11.100
how could she have

08:11.900 --> 08:13.590
killed Elder Yue in one move?

08:16.300 --> 08:17.900
Right now, our conjecture is

08:18.070 --> 08:19.490
that since the person could approach Elder Yue

08:19.490 --> 08:21.550
easily in the Council of Elders Hall,

08:21.780 --> 08:24.180
it must be someone who's close to Elder Yue.

08:24.380 --> 08:25.300
But Shangguan Qian

08:25.300 --> 08:28.160
is only a bride who just entered the Gong residence.

08:28.160 --> 08:31.880
How could she have gone in and out of the Council of Elders Hall freely?

08:31.880 --> 08:34.409
Even if she had a reason to approach Elder Yue,

08:34.919 --> 08:37.130
Elder Yue wouldn't be defenseless.

08:38.000 --> 08:39.260
Then why did Shangguan Qian

08:39.260 --> 08:40.990
wander around in black clothes

08:41.650 --> 08:43.250
and head to the Yu residence?

08:45.810 --> 08:47.610
We don't know about that for now.

08:49.130 --> 08:50.930
But I'll know the answer soon.

08:51.990 --> 08:53.690
Young Master Shangjue, I hope you

08:53.690 --> 08:55.570
won’t show mercy

08:55.730 --> 08:57.930
just because she's the bride you chose.

09:00.340 --> 09:03.340
I will definitely give all the elders an explanation.

09:03.410 --> 09:03.780
But

09:04.830 --> 09:06.560
I’m curious about one thing.

09:08.650 --> 09:10.120
How did Elder Hua know

09:10.640 --> 09:12.970
that the person in black clothes is a woman

09:13.170 --> 09:14.500
and that she's injured,

09:15.190 --> 09:16.260
and ordered

09:16.810 --> 09:18.730
for all residences to be searched?

09:18.730 --> 09:19.390
Um...

09:20.040 --> 09:20.760
Who are you?

09:22.060 --> 09:26.390
There is no woman with such martial arts skills like you in the Gong residence.

09:26.870 --> 09:29.110
It was because the Yellow Jade Guardian by my side

09:29.110 --> 09:31.040
encountered a suspicious person.

09:31.330 --> 09:32.260
During the fight,

09:32.260 --> 09:34.190
judging from her voice and figure,

09:34.570 --> 09:36.500
he determined that she was a woman.

09:37.310 --> 09:38.100
I see.

09:39.370 --> 09:41.770
Since Shangguan Qian has been imprisoned,

09:41.770 --> 09:44.430
we'll wait for the result of her interrogation.

10:13.890 --> 10:15.600
Anonymous appeared again.

10:15.820 --> 10:17.270
Lady Wuji was attacked.

10:17.700 --> 10:19.620
The Gong residence is now heavily guarded.

10:19.620 --> 10:21.620
I can't come here for the time being.

10:21.910 --> 10:23.510
My return date is uncertain.

10:23.600 --> 10:25.230
I'll resume with the unfinished research

10:25.230 --> 10:26.410
when I come back.

10:27.060 --> 10:28.060
If it's urgent,

10:28.060 --> 10:31.110
you can fly this gold leaf kite in the air.

10:31.540 --> 10:33.730
I'll come to you as soon as I see it.

10:34.060 --> 10:34.840
Don't worry.

10:35.170 --> 10:36.240
From Xiaohei.

10:38.220 --> 10:39.500
Who will miss you?

10:39.730 --> 10:40.820
You're not Jin Fan.

10:57.190 --> 10:58.420
The servants just informed

10:58.420 --> 11:00.380
that the elders locked up the Sword Wielder in the confinement room

11:00.380 --> 11:01.870
to get him to reflect on his mistakes.

11:01.870 --> 11:03.270
He won't be back tonight.

11:04.850 --> 11:06.580
Miss Yun, he asked me to tell you

11:07.070 --> 11:08.190
to rest early.

11:08.490 --> 11:09.750
Don't worry about him.

11:11.610 --> 11:13.580
If I hadn't suggested to leave the Gong residence...

11:13.580 --> 11:15.380
Don't blame yourself, Miss Yun.

11:15.730 --> 11:16.860
It was also the Sword Wielder's decision

11:16.860 --> 11:18.460
to leave the Gong residence.

11:19.140 --> 11:20.030
He has accepted

11:20.540 --> 11:22.070
the punishment willingly.

11:23.340 --> 11:25.740
I'm just telling you what he said verbatim.

11:26.090 --> 11:28.490
It doesn't represent my personal opinion.

11:30.130 --> 11:32.130
Young Master Ziyu doesn't blame me.

11:32.840 --> 11:33.720
But I know

11:36.360 --> 11:38.420
you must have resentment towards me.

11:38.920 --> 11:41.920
Miss Yun, you shouldn't have wandered around indeed.

11:42.150 --> 11:44.500
Not only did you make Young Master Ziyu worried,

11:44.500 --> 11:45.900
but also caused trouble.

11:48.100 --> 11:48.700
I'm sorry.

11:50.520 --> 11:52.380
You don't need to apologize to me.

11:52.770 --> 11:54.430
I'm just a Green Jade Guardian.

11:54.430 --> 11:55.430
I can't afford it.

11:57.760 --> 11:58.840
I just hope that...

11:58.870 --> 12:01.730
you wouldn't let the Sword Wielder down from now on.

12:01.940 --> 12:02.370
He...

12:05.970 --> 12:07.500
is a foolishly good person.

12:10.440 --> 12:11.920
Rest early, Miss Yun.

12:14.180 --> 12:14.670
Wait.

12:17.260 --> 12:19.200
Have you found the injured woman

12:19.410 --> 12:20.790
after searching the residence tonight?

12:20.790 --> 12:21.340
Yes.

12:22.380 --> 12:23.580
It's Shangguan Qian.

13:32.660 --> 13:34.320
The wine bowls are still full.

13:35.910 --> 13:36.650
It seems

13:37.220 --> 13:39.020
that it hasn't gone that far yet.

13:40.330 --> 13:42.730
You've endured the whipping and clamping.

13:44.260 --> 13:44.890
But...

13:45.450 --> 13:46.980
this is just the beginning.

13:48.560 --> 13:50.050
The razor in my hand

13:50.820 --> 13:52.330
is durable and sharp.

13:52.570 --> 13:55.730
It was forged by the Gong family's hidden weapon forging technique.

13:55.730 --> 13:56.860
This razor is called

13:57.240 --> 13:58.240
the Cicada Razor.

13:58.720 --> 14:00.320
It can cut every piece of meat

14:00.810 --> 14:02.940
into slices as thin as a cicada's wing.

14:03.670 --> 14:04.880
Just slicing a leg

14:06.840 --> 14:08.850
would take an entire day.

14:10.420 --> 14:11.880
It's worse than death.

14:19.550 --> 14:20.720
And this mask.

14:26.780 --> 14:28.040
Such a beautiful face.

14:31.030 --> 14:31.980
What a pity.

14:39.830 --> 14:41.670
And this bowl of wine.

14:41.990 --> 14:43.810
The razor and mask just now

14:44.240 --> 14:46.510
are not worth mentioning

14:48.430 --> 14:51.160
when compared to Brother Yuanzhi's poison wine.

14:58.620 --> 14:59.300
So,

15:00.570 --> 15:01.970
are you going to confess?

15:05.610 --> 15:06.520
Trust me.

15:08.190 --> 15:09.720
You won't be able to take it.

15:11.020 --> 15:12.630
As long as you tell the truth,

15:14.730 --> 15:16.260
I promise you won't suffer.

15:19.610 --> 15:21.120
Can you keep me alive?

15:30.790 --> 15:32.320
I promise you won't suffer.

15:41.700 --> 15:42.650
If I tell you,

15:45.470 --> 15:46.670
would you believe me?

15:48.510 --> 15:50.240
Just tell me your perspective.

15:50.750 --> 15:52.480
I'll make the judgment myself.

16:01.010 --> 16:02.480
I'm not a Wufeng assassin,

16:02.840 --> 16:04.640
nor am I the so-called Anonymous

16:05.000 --> 16:06.460
who you're talking about.

16:07.360 --> 16:08.090
But

16:10.100 --> 16:13.160
I'm not the daughter from the Shangguan family indeed.

16:14.010 --> 16:14.560
Then,

16:15.640 --> 16:16.650
who are you?

16:19.540 --> 16:21.140
An orphan of the Gushan Sect.

16:22.020 --> 16:23.620
I entered the Gong residence

16:23.970 --> 16:25.030
to protect myself.

16:27.760 --> 16:28.700
The Gushan Sect?

16:30.660 --> 16:31.120
Yes.

16:33.570 --> 16:35.700
Back then, Zhuo Mei from Qingfeng Sect

16:35.740 --> 16:37.200
fell in love with my uncle,

16:38.570 --> 16:40.430
which met with strong opposition

16:41.890 --> 16:44.150
from the Qingfeng Sect Leader, Dianzhu.

16:44.860 --> 16:47.390
To force the Gushan Sect to hand over my uncle,

16:47.850 --> 16:50.590
Dianzhu, who was already seeking refuge with Wufeng,

16:50.590 --> 16:51.990
led the Wufeng assassins

16:52.760 --> 16:53.660
to Gushan Sect

16:54.290 --> 16:55.550
and wiped the sect out.

16:57.340 --> 16:59.400
The entire Gushan Sect was wiped out.

17:00.820 --> 17:02.090
I've never heard

17:03.380 --> 17:04.890
that there were any Gushan Sect descendants who survived.

17:04.890 --> 17:06.950
My father hid me in the secret tunnel.

17:07.630 --> 17:09.300
That's how I survived.

17:13.920 --> 17:15.319
Later, I wandered around

17:16.380 --> 17:17.380
and was homeless.

17:18.980 --> 17:21.329
Fortunately, I was saved by the Shangguan family

17:21.329 --> 17:22.609
and they raised me.

17:24.420 --> 17:28.060
The Shangguan family didn't want their daughter to marry into the Gong family.

17:28.060 --> 17:29.260
In order to repay them

17:29.450 --> 17:30.720
for raising me,

17:31.720 --> 17:33.040
and for myself,

17:34.970 --> 17:36.900
I pretended to be Shangguan Qian

17:37.730 --> 17:39.330
and got married in her stead.

17:40.780 --> 17:41.840
I swore

17:43.070 --> 17:44.720
that I'd avenge my father

17:45.640 --> 17:47.040
and my sect.

17:50.950 --> 17:52.880
On the Lantern Festival that year,

17:53.060 --> 17:54.410
I ran into a gangster.

17:56.620 --> 17:58.220
You were the one who saved me.

18:01.250 --> 18:03.890
That's why I came up with the plan to enter the Gong residence

18:03.890 --> 18:05.360
to have someone to rely on.

18:08.190 --> 18:10.250
Only with the power of the Gong family

18:11.350 --> 18:13.210
can I take revenge.

18:18.470 --> 18:20.330
Then what does this have to do with

18:21.200 --> 18:23.260
you trying to assassinate Gong Ziyu?

18:23.860 --> 18:24.860
Gong Ziyu?

18:25.920 --> 18:27.280
My target was Wuji.

18:28.490 --> 18:29.050
Why?

18:31.300 --> 18:32.630
Because I heard that day

18:33.730 --> 18:36.130
that you suspected that Wuji is Anonymous.

18:36.920 --> 18:38.500
And every one from Wufeng

18:39.710 --> 18:40.820
is my enemy.

18:43.330 --> 18:45.060
When I went to the Yu residence,

18:45.290 --> 18:47.300
I saw Wuji in Gong Ziyu's room.

18:48.400 --> 18:50.660
So I observed her from behind the window.

18:51.960 --> 18:53.050
But I saw

18:54.130 --> 18:56.190
that Wuji had a soft sword in her hand.

18:57.180 --> 18:59.230
That sword was thin and tough.

18:59.730 --> 19:03.330
It's no different from the sword that people from Wufeng usually used.

19:03.330 --> 19:04.660
So I was sure

19:05.130 --> 19:06.460
that Wuji is Anonymous.

19:09.780 --> 19:11.400
But I was discovered by Wuji.

19:13.580 --> 19:15.140
She's stronger than me in terms of martial arts skills.

19:15.140 --> 19:18.440
Since she's stronger than you in terms of martial arts skills,

19:18.440 --> 19:19.340
why

19:20.120 --> 19:21.650
was she still stabbed by you?

19:21.650 --> 19:22.980
Wuji did it herself.

19:24.370 --> 19:26.020
She deliberately let the sword escape from her hand

19:26.020 --> 19:27.110
and I grabbed it,

19:27.490 --> 19:29.820
and she charged towards me to get stabbed.

19:34.800 --> 19:35.670
You mean

19:38.490 --> 19:40.190
she got stabbed on purpose?

19:44.330 --> 19:44.800
Yes.

20:07.270 --> 20:08.530
Is everything you said

20:10.120 --> 20:11.480
true?

20:17.560 --> 20:18.190
It's

20:18.220 --> 20:19.130
all true.

20:30.730 --> 20:32.060
Do you really want me

20:34.810 --> 20:36.090
to torture you?

20:38.420 --> 20:39.700
Everything I said

20:39.890 --> 20:40.710
is true.

20:42.410 --> 20:44.140
I'm not afraid of your torture.

21:12.310 --> 21:14.640
I have proof that I'm from the Gushan Sect.

21:18.680 --> 21:19.790
Untie me.

21:21.420 --> 21:22.790
I'll prove it to you.

21:28.460 --> 21:30.260
I'm already seriously injured.

21:31.960 --> 21:34.310
If you are even afraid of me in this state,

21:36.420 --> 21:39.550
you don’t deserve your reputation in the martial world.

22:07.660 --> 22:08.260
Prove it.

22:52.250 --> 22:57.720
♫You whisper loving words in my ear♫

22:59.150 --> 23:04.180
♫Yet we have no choice but to part♫

23:05.960 --> 23:12.100
♫I hold the blade in my hand♫

23:12.330 --> 23:17.720
♫And slice through the night♫

23:31.410 --> 23:32.740
Are you feeling better?

23:33.820 --> 23:34.350
Brother.

23:35.060 --> 23:35.640
I'm fine.

23:37.750 --> 23:41.210
Did you find anything out from interrogating Shangguan Qian?

23:45.720 --> 23:46.720
Brother, tell me.

23:47.620 --> 23:49.220
Did Shangguan Qian confess?

23:49.380 --> 23:51.700
Although she didn't poison the porridge last night,

23:51.700 --> 23:53.210
I still don't believe her.

23:56.090 --> 23:57.950
She told me she's not from Wufeng,

23:58.990 --> 24:00.190
nor is she Anonymous.

24:08.340 --> 24:08.870
Brother.

24:11.500 --> 24:12.960
Do you trust her this much?

24:22.780 --> 24:23.870
Shangguan Qian

24:24.590 --> 24:27.250
has the birthmark of the Gushan Sect on her body.

24:27.270 --> 24:28.130
This birthmark

24:28.790 --> 24:31.320
represents the bloodline of the Gushan Sect.

24:31.940 --> 24:34.940
There is a clear record of this in their family record.

24:35.840 --> 24:38.300
Although the Gushan Sect has been wiped out,

24:38.410 --> 24:39.900
there are relevant files

24:40.210 --> 24:41.470
in the Gong residence.

24:43.050 --> 24:44.960
I have reviewed them and verified it already.

24:44.960 --> 24:45.740
Gushan Sect?

24:46.990 --> 24:50.120
The descendants of Gushan Sect may still be from Wufeng.

24:50.600 --> 24:51.600
Over these years,

24:52.490 --> 24:56.390
there have been many righteous sects in the martial world that have fallen and joined Wufeng.

24:56.390 --> 24:56.870
Indeed.

24:58.540 --> 25:00.940
That's why I need to wait until Wuji wakes up

25:00.980 --> 25:02.440
to hear what she has to say.

25:03.210 --> 25:05.670
After all, there are so many puzzling points

25:05.810 --> 25:07.540
that still can't be explained.

25:08.340 --> 25:10.000
I don't trust Shangguan Qian,

25:10.720 --> 25:12.520
but I don't trust Wuji even more.

25:13.230 --> 25:14.490
You shouldn't believe

25:15.820 --> 25:16.750
what she says.

25:21.290 --> 25:22.260
Young Master Yuanzhi.

25:22.260 --> 25:23.060
Young Master.

25:23.230 --> 25:24.290
Lady Wuji is awake.

25:28.540 --> 25:29.070
Brother.

25:29.860 --> 25:30.770
I'll go with you.

25:30.770 --> 25:31.230
No need.

25:33.130 --> 25:35.060
Focus on your recuperation first.

25:36.110 --> 25:38.270
Whether it's Shangguan Qian or Wuji,

25:39.590 --> 25:40.870
I have my own plans.

25:44.810 --> 25:45.940
Jin Fu, lead the way.

26:03.140 --> 26:03.740
Lady Wuji.

26:04.070 --> 26:04.870
You're awake.

26:07.910 --> 26:09.180
Anonymous' target

26:10.180 --> 26:11.110
was actually me.

26:13.580 --> 26:14.280
I was the one

26:15.450 --> 26:16.580
who implicated you.

26:16.710 --> 26:18.240
I'm glad you weren't there.

26:19.900 --> 26:21.040
At my age,

26:21.660 --> 26:22.990
it's no big deal if I die.

26:23.410 --> 26:27.270
But you still have to be responsible for the future of the Gong family.

26:28.580 --> 26:29.180
Lady Wuji.

26:29.260 --> 26:30.030
Calm down.

26:31.740 --> 26:33.220
Luckily, Anonymous from last night

26:33.220 --> 26:34.150
has been caught.

26:34.180 --> 26:35.770
They are interrogating her now.

26:35.770 --> 26:37.420
You've been avenged.

26:39.620 --> 26:41.150
They've caught Anonymous?

26:42.140 --> 26:42.790
Yes.

26:44.540 --> 26:45.740
It's Shangguan Qian.

26:52.860 --> 26:53.930
I heard you woke up,

26:54.480 --> 26:56.280
so I came to visit you, Lady Wuji.

26:57.900 --> 26:58.600
Thank you.

27:00.140 --> 27:01.040
May I ask

27:02.010 --> 27:03.120
if you remember

27:03.760 --> 27:05.220
what happened last night?

27:12.210 --> 27:13.470
Lady Wuji just woke up.

27:13.540 --> 27:14.470
Her head isn't clear yet.

27:14.470 --> 27:15.930
The doctor will determine

27:16.620 --> 27:18.420
whether her head is clear or not.

27:26.380 --> 27:26.980
Lady Wuji,

27:27.990 --> 27:29.450
do you remember anything?

27:30.230 --> 27:31.230
I also want to know

27:31.490 --> 27:32.570
what happened.

27:35.060 --> 27:35.960
A few days ago,

27:37.530 --> 27:39.330
a small batch of fox fur arrived.

27:41.860 --> 27:43.080
At night,

27:44.410 --> 27:46.010
I wanted to get you to pick one

27:46.400 --> 27:47.710
to make a cloak for you.

27:49.560 --> 27:50.890
But Ziyu wasn't around.

27:53.540 --> 27:54.800
Just now, Ziyu told me

27:55.490 --> 27:56.950
he caught Shangguan Qian.

27:58.890 --> 28:00.050
I didn't expect her

28:01.650 --> 28:02.990
to be Anonymous.

28:05.100 --> 28:06.330
She's not Anonymous.

28:10.220 --> 28:11.420
She's not Anonymous?

28:12.710 --> 28:14.240
Have you interrogated her?

28:15.500 --> 28:16.960
If she weren't Anonymous,

28:16.960 --> 28:18.440
why did she sneak into Yu Lineage

28:18.440 --> 28:19.500
and stab Lady Wuji?

28:21.620 --> 28:22.750
Shangguan Qian said

28:23.340 --> 28:25.740
she heard our conversation during the day.

28:26.100 --> 28:29.280
So she wanted to test Lady Wuji

28:30.700 --> 28:31.410
and see

28:32.400 --> 28:33.840
if she was Anonymous.

28:36.420 --> 28:37.150
Ridiculous.

28:42.820 --> 28:43.530
Is this

28:45.180 --> 28:48.230
the soft sword you hid in your belt, Lady Wuji?

28:49.210 --> 28:49.690
Yes.

28:52.120 --> 28:52.770
Lady Wuji,

28:53.710 --> 28:55.510
were you hurt by this soft sword?

29:00.730 --> 29:02.530
When I arrived at the Yu Lineage,

29:02.770 --> 29:04.370
I found the blood on the wall.

29:05.590 --> 29:07.020
Shangguan Qian arrived

29:09.120 --> 29:10.720
before I could call for help.

29:11.480 --> 29:12.540
She attacked me

29:13.410 --> 29:14.540
without any reason.

29:16.570 --> 29:19.080
I can only draw my soft sword to fight the enemy.

29:19.080 --> 29:20.280
I was no match for her.

29:21.340 --> 29:22.800
She snatched my soft sword

29:23.260 --> 29:24.620
and stabbed me in the back.

29:24.620 --> 29:25.950
But Shangguan Qian said

29:26.700 --> 29:28.030
she was no match for you.

29:29.020 --> 29:30.210
It was you

29:31.020 --> 29:32.280
who purposely ran into

29:33.020 --> 29:34.300
this soft sword.

29:34.330 --> 29:34.860
Enough.

29:36.660 --> 29:38.860
Shangguan Qian was caught red-handed.

29:39.630 --> 29:41.560
It's fine if you don't suspect her.

29:41.710 --> 29:43.220
But you easily trusted

29:43.220 --> 29:44.290
the nonsensical words

29:44.290 --> 29:45.690
of a desperate prisoner.

29:45.870 --> 29:47.240
This is not the brain

29:47.420 --> 29:48.850
you should have, Gong Shangjue.

29:48.850 --> 29:50.450
My father used to love to say,

29:51.380 --> 29:53.580
"If one's not stupid, one must be evil."

29:53.920 --> 29:55.520
I don't think you're stupid.

30:01.220 --> 30:02.510
During the day,

30:03.290 --> 30:05.290
I only just mentioned that Lady Wuji

30:05.400 --> 30:06.850
might be Anonymous.

30:08.900 --> 30:10.500
On that very night,

30:11.250 --> 30:13.580
Anonymous attempted to assassinate her.

30:14.310 --> 30:15.270
Isn't this

30:16.370 --> 30:18.200
too coincidental?

30:21.660 --> 30:23.120
Actually, this soft sword

30:24.620 --> 30:26.000
can prove that

30:26.570 --> 30:28.110
Lady Wuji isn't Anonymous.

30:32.520 --> 30:33.450
What do you mean?

30:34.330 --> 30:36.460
Elder Yue’s wound was thin and narrow.

30:38.570 --> 30:40.510
But the width of this sword

30:41.700 --> 30:44.830
is obviously longer than the width of Elder Yue’s wound.

30:45.190 --> 30:45.880
So,

30:47.210 --> 30:50.010
this sword is not the weapon used to kill Elder Yue.

30:51.930 --> 30:52.890
And I think

30:54.490 --> 30:55.950
there should be no reason

30:56.580 --> 30:58.340
for Anonymous to change weapons

30:58.340 --> 30:59.870
when they killed Elder Yue.

31:02.050 --> 31:03.100
You're right.

31:05.160 --> 31:05.950
But...

31:08.610 --> 31:09.740
How did you know

31:10.600 --> 31:12.460
how narrow Elder Yue’s wound was?

31:15.580 --> 31:16.420
Unless

31:17.140 --> 31:19.130
you're very familiar with

31:19.640 --> 31:21.560
the murder weapon

31:22.900 --> 31:23.960
we're looking for.

31:28.460 --> 31:29.720
I told her about it.

31:31.120 --> 31:32.880
When you were not here,

31:34.660 --> 31:36.500
we were talking about this.

31:38.240 --> 31:39.420
I told her

31:40.470 --> 31:41.240
Master Yue

31:41.740 --> 31:43.670
was killed by Wufeng's thin sword.

32:09.790 --> 32:12.650
Shangguan Qian is indeed an orphan of the Gushan Sect.

32:12.650 --> 32:15.230
The birthmark of the bloodline can't be faked.

32:15.230 --> 32:16.890
With the previous inference,

32:16.900 --> 32:18.220
it is enough to prove that

32:18.220 --> 32:20.080
Shangguan Qian is not Anonymous.

32:21.010 --> 32:22.700
Since she's not Anonymous,

32:23.620 --> 32:24.350
then...

32:25.140 --> 32:26.540
who left the words

32:26.830 --> 32:27.850
on the screen?

32:28.430 --> 32:30.090
I'm afraid the real Anonymous

32:30.780 --> 32:31.710
hid in the dark

32:32.020 --> 32:33.800
and deliberately left the blood writing

32:33.800 --> 32:35.200
to confuse the witnesses

32:35.230 --> 32:36.160
and cause panic.

32:37.430 --> 32:38.360
Shangguan Qian

32:38.700 --> 32:40.260
injured Lady Wuji.

32:41.780 --> 32:43.780
But her action was understandable.

32:43.900 --> 32:44.760
The torture she

32:44.930 --> 32:46.110
received in prison

32:46.930 --> 32:48.930
will be considered her punishment.

32:51.620 --> 32:52.550
Can we

32:53.540 --> 32:54.710
release her now?

32:56.500 --> 32:57.900
Her background

32:58.820 --> 32:59.880
is really pitiful.

33:00.530 --> 33:03.000
The former leader of the Gushan Sect

33:03.100 --> 33:05.170
was loyal and righteous.

33:05.540 --> 33:08.090
It was also a rare sect in the martial world

33:08.380 --> 33:10.510
who always supported the Gong family.

33:11.110 --> 33:13.850
But in the end, they were killed

33:13.870 --> 33:15.670
by the Qingfeng Sect and Wufeng.

33:16.470 --> 33:17.340
Since

33:17.560 --> 33:19.160
this is a misunderstanding,

33:19.540 --> 33:20.160
I think

33:21.260 --> 33:22.380
we can let her out.

33:23.100 --> 33:23.960
Shangguan Qian

33:24.110 --> 33:25.440
belongs to Jue Lineage.

33:25.910 --> 33:26.750
Shangjue,

33:27.180 --> 33:28.310
handle it yourself.

33:36.610 --> 33:37.060
Yes.

33:40.350 --> 33:41.620
Right now, Anonymous

33:41.620 --> 33:43.100
is still at large.

33:43.350 --> 33:45.290
I'm afraid they will continue to create trouble.

33:45.290 --> 33:45.950
Should we

33:46.180 --> 33:48.830
consider activating the Infinite Heat

33:49.290 --> 33:50.350
to threaten Wufeng

33:51.020 --> 33:52.550
and ensure the safety of the Gong family?

33:52.550 --> 33:53.060
No!

33:59.930 --> 34:00.570
No.

34:02.460 --> 34:03.050
This

34:03.400 --> 34:04.400
is not a good idea.

34:08.540 --> 34:09.139
Elder Xue,

34:10.810 --> 34:12.550
what is

34:12.810 --> 34:13.870
the Infinite Heat?

34:15.250 --> 34:16.780
Why have I never heard of it?

34:24.340 --> 34:25.909
You will know about it

34:26.900 --> 34:28.630
once you pass all three trials.

34:31.500 --> 34:33.139
Sword Wielder, you should start

34:33.139 --> 34:35.000
working on the second trial soon.

34:51.159 --> 34:53.290
I'm here to visit Miss Shangguan Qian.

34:57.060 --> 34:58.300
Young Master Shangjue,

34:58.300 --> 35:00.060
Miss Shangguan is seriously injured.

35:00.060 --> 35:01.830
Fortunately, it’s only external.

35:01.830 --> 35:03.790
I prescribed some medicine and ointment.

35:03.790 --> 35:06.050
She'll be fine after half a month of rest.

35:06.540 --> 35:06.980
Okay.

35:07.970 --> 35:08.770
You may leave.

35:09.260 --> 35:09.720
Yes.

35:15.630 --> 35:16.340
Looks like

35:16.540 --> 35:18.000
you still showed mercy.

35:18.530 --> 35:20.090
The fine brew I made

35:20.660 --> 35:21.890
remains unutilized.

35:23.180 --> 35:23.820
No hurry.

35:24.610 --> 35:26.140
We'll use them eventually.

35:26.830 --> 35:27.690
Not now,

35:30.050 --> 35:31.360
nor on Shangguan Qian.

35:34.780 --> 35:35.240
Sir.

35:35.620 --> 35:36.880
Young Master Yuanzhi.

35:37.210 --> 35:38.610
Miss Yun Weishan is here.

35:38.950 --> 35:41.680
She said she wanted to visit Miss Shangguan Qian.

35:43.300 --> 35:43.970
Hmm.

35:45.610 --> 35:46.610
Let her in.

35:47.340 --> 35:47.700
Yes.

35:47.700 --> 35:48.240
Wait.

35:50.900 --> 35:52.700
Did she bring anything?

35:53.610 --> 35:54.010
Yes.

35:54.410 --> 35:55.870
She brought a brocade box.

36:01.910 --> 36:02.590
Stop.

36:13.270 --> 36:13.870
Recently,

36:13.980 --> 36:15.680
there are a lot of incidents in the Gong residence.

36:15.680 --> 36:17.250
The Jue Lineage is heavily guarded.

36:17.250 --> 36:18.420
My brother has ordered

36:18.420 --> 36:20.380
to check everything that goes in and out

36:20.380 --> 36:21.460
of the Jue Lineage.

36:22.380 --> 36:22.990
Miss Yun.

36:23.770 --> 36:25.030
Please open the box.

36:37.180 --> 36:37.600
Hey.

36:38.620 --> 36:39.910
Leave the box.

36:49.170 --> 36:50.590
It's just an empty box.

36:52.220 --> 36:52.940
Leave it.

37:20.880 --> 37:21.610
Are you okay?

37:23.930 --> 37:25.850
It's nothing serious.

37:26.340 --> 37:27.880
Thank you for your concern.

37:30.000 --> 37:32.400
Shangguan, your hands and feet are so cold.

37:32.740 --> 37:34.800
It seems that your body is still weak.

37:34.980 --> 37:36.710
I brought some ginseng for you.

37:36.740 --> 37:38.270
I passed it to the servants.

37:39.530 --> 37:41.260
The ginseng is of high quality.

37:41.950 --> 37:43.750
It will help with your recovery.

37:44.310 --> 37:45.370
Remember to eat it.

37:45.740 --> 37:47.000
Thank you, Sister Yun.

37:49.180 --> 37:50.630
I didn't expect you to be

37:50.730 --> 37:52.330
an orphan of the Gushan Sect.

37:54.720 --> 37:56.520
Is Lady Wuji really Anonymous?

37:58.310 --> 37:59.000
Yes.

37:59.890 --> 38:02.060
It seems that we're connected by fate.

38:02.860 --> 38:04.590
I heard that your master is

38:04.840 --> 38:05.750
Zhuo Mei.

38:07.350 --> 38:08.430
You live in the Yu Lineage,

38:08.430 --> 38:10.490
you spent the longest time with Wuji.

38:10.590 --> 38:12.790
I don't believe you didn't suspect her.

38:16.300 --> 38:17.300
It really is fate.

38:17.880 --> 38:19.880
And now, we meet each other here.

38:20.450 --> 38:21.600
What a coincidence.

38:22.700 --> 38:25.560
I hope we can spend more time together in the future.

38:26.570 --> 38:29.230
My family was destroyed and I was alone.

38:29.980 --> 38:30.990
All these years,

38:31.270 --> 38:33.470
I have no one to share my thoughts with.

38:35.420 --> 38:38.220
Whether you really don't know or are playing dumb,

38:38.370 --> 38:40.010
Wufeng's spies

38:40.410 --> 38:42.270
won't interfere with each other.

38:43.060 --> 38:44.510
If you don't mind,

38:44.980 --> 38:46.610
you can come to me often.

38:47.370 --> 38:48.780
Have a good rest.

38:48.810 --> 38:49.880
I won't bother you.

38:50.490 --> 38:51.780
I'll visit you again.

39:10.090 --> 39:10.620
Brother.

39:11.980 --> 39:14.180
Are you still worried about Anonymous?

39:14.730 --> 39:16.710
Anonymous did not complete

39:17.840 --> 39:19.440
the final stroke on the wall.

39:19.940 --> 39:22.400
Obviously, they stopped when someone came.

39:24.440 --> 39:28.170
If this person could come and go without a trace right under my nose,

39:29.040 --> 39:30.840
I'm afraid the whole Gong family

39:31.460 --> 39:33.030
is no match for Anonymous.

39:41.060 --> 39:43.320
I've brought Yun Weishan's brocade box.

39:43.400 --> 39:44.600
It's ginseng inside.

39:45.420 --> 39:46.350
Shall I check it?

39:47.460 --> 39:47.920
Yes.

39:49.840 --> 39:51.370
Check both the ginseng

39:52.940 --> 39:54.070
and the brocade box.

39:54.850 --> 39:55.910
That's my brother.

40:06.970 --> 40:09.100
I've packed the luggage for tomorrow.

40:09.300 --> 40:11.100
Do you have anything else for me?

40:12.100 --> 40:13.960
We haven't caught Anonymous yet.

40:14.020 --> 40:15.220
I think Gong Shangjue

40:15.370 --> 40:16.830
is still eyeing Lady Wuji.

40:17.690 --> 40:18.820
When I'm not around,

40:19.340 --> 40:20.870
you must protect Lady Wuji.

40:21.360 --> 40:22.760
Don't give him the chance

40:23.060 --> 40:24.590
to slander Lady Wuji again.

40:25.400 --> 40:26.130
Understood.

40:28.850 --> 40:29.510
That aside,

40:29.980 --> 40:31.180
did you find anything

40:31.300 --> 40:32.780
in Housekeeper Jia's house?

40:32.780 --> 40:35.100
Housekeeper Jia's wife and child have moved away

40:35.100 --> 40:36.030
one month before

40:36.380 --> 40:39.310
the former Sword Wielder and Young Lord were killed.

40:39.820 --> 40:41.210
What's more suspicious is...

40:41.210 --> 40:42.650
According to the neighbors,

40:42.650 --> 40:44.020
someone looked for his wife

40:44.020 --> 40:45.320
and child before us.

40:47.060 --> 40:48.820
Was it someone working for Gong Shangjue?

40:48.820 --> 40:49.630
I think so.

40:50.180 --> 40:51.440
The two people who came

40:51.620 --> 40:52.460
also asked

40:52.540 --> 40:53.390
why

40:53.540 --> 40:55.340
Old Man Jia's family moved away.

40:55.810 --> 40:56.860
Their family

40:57.200 --> 40:59.260
moved away before the Laba Festival.

40:59.780 --> 41:02.560
It seems that they moved away before the former Sword Wielder was killed.

41:02.560 --> 41:04.420
There was another strange thing.

41:04.940 --> 41:05.440
What?

41:05.820 --> 41:08.080
Do they have any relatives?

41:09.580 --> 41:11.720
They seldom have contact.

41:14.580 --> 41:16.100
Because of their son.

41:16.500 --> 41:17.560
People around here

41:17.610 --> 41:18.780
were afraid of him.

41:19.510 --> 41:21.090
What's wrong with his son?

41:21.780 --> 41:22.700
Old Man Jia

41:22.700 --> 41:24.060
got a son at such an old age.

41:24.060 --> 41:25.060
He was very happy.

41:25.660 --> 41:26.710
But two years ago,

41:26.740 --> 41:28.890
his son suddenly got seriously ill.

41:29.020 --> 41:30.490
No one could cure him.

41:32.010 --> 41:35.020
They almost prepared a coffin for the kid.

41:36.540 --> 41:38.940
Later, a physician from the Gong family cured him.

41:38.940 --> 41:40.460
He came back to life?

41:41.510 --> 41:42.320
The child

41:42.780 --> 41:43.820
was cured, yes.

41:44.600 --> 41:45.810
But since then,

41:46.600 --> 41:48.310
he became a little weird.

41:49.690 --> 41:51.180
How so?

41:55.140 --> 41:55.900
That kid

41:55.980 --> 41:57.050
became very strong

41:57.180 --> 41:58.450
all of a sudden.

41:59.570 --> 42:01.570
When he was playing with other kids,

42:01.780 --> 42:02.840
he shoved

42:03.100 --> 42:04.650
a little girl away

42:04.670 --> 42:05.940
by a couple of meters.

42:05.980 --> 42:09.520
Her head bled from the shove.

42:09.580 --> 42:10.500
Isn't it scary?

42:10.500 --> 42:11.900
So scary!

42:13.070 --> 42:15.400
Housekeeper Jia's son was seriously ill.

42:15.460 --> 42:18.560
In the end, he was cured by a physician from the Gong family.

42:18.560 --> 42:19.890
But after he recovered,

42:20.060 --> 42:21.320
he became very strong.

42:23.080 --> 42:24.280
Keep investigating.

42:24.340 --> 42:25.070
Understood.

42:48.810 --> 42:50.670
We're already in the wild, right?

42:50.950 --> 42:51.400
Yes.

42:52.340 --> 42:53.540
It smells like grass.

42:53.950 --> 42:55.950
I can smell the moisture in the wind.

42:56.500 --> 42:57.370
We must have

42:57.690 --> 42:59.020
left the secret tunnel.

42:59.680 --> 43:00.750
Lord Sword Wielder.

43:00.750 --> 43:01.410
We're here.

43:01.880 --> 43:03.880
You can take off your blindfold now.

43:22.660 --> 43:23.460
Elder Yue.

43:27.860 --> 43:29.300
This is not the front hill.

43:29.300 --> 43:29.880
So,

43:30.120 --> 43:31.780
just call me Young Master Yue.

43:32.570 --> 43:34.770
Young Master Ziyu, please come with me.

43:53.780 --> 43:56.870
[Jue]

44:19.210 --> 44:20.470
Young Master Yuanzhi.

44:20.650 --> 44:22.910
Are you disappointed I'm not my brother?

44:23.500 --> 44:25.100
Don't pretend to be pitiful.

44:25.820 --> 44:27.150
My brother can't see it.

44:28.570 --> 44:30.820
Young Master Yuanzhi, you must be joking.

44:30.820 --> 44:32.310
Look at my wounds.

44:32.980 --> 44:34.640
Do I look like I'm pretending?

44:36.580 --> 44:37.680
Are you hoping that

44:37.850 --> 44:39.140
if my brother sees you

44:39.140 --> 44:40.710
looking so miserable,

44:41.590 --> 44:43.350
he'll take care of you?

44:45.210 --> 44:46.440
I know my place.

44:47.460 --> 44:49.120
I've been injured for so long.

44:49.270 --> 44:51.730
Young Master Shangjue has never visited me.

44:53.940 --> 44:56.080
Unlike when you were injured,

44:56.450 --> 44:59.050
Young Master Shangjue was always by your side.

45:00.270 --> 45:01.200
I'm his brother.

45:02.030 --> 45:03.830
You cannot even begin to imagine

45:04.490 --> 45:06.020
the bond we have growing up.

45:07.620 --> 45:08.870
If one day,

45:09.780 --> 45:11.980
Young Master Shangjue would care for me

45:12.460 --> 45:14.720
even a tiny bit as much as he cares for you,

45:15.950 --> 45:17.010
I'll be satisfied.

45:19.470 --> 45:20.530
I don't think you're the kind

45:20.530 --> 45:21.990
to be satisfied so easily.

45:23.720 --> 45:25.580
There is a word carved

45:26.740 --> 45:28.070
between your eyebrows.

45:31.380 --> 45:31.900
Greed?

45:35.180 --> 45:35.910
Or ambition?

45:39.340 --> 45:40.730
Wufeng.

45:47.530 --> 45:48.250
Yuanzhi.

45:49.370 --> 45:50.900
I heard from the servants that

45:50.900 --> 45:51.700
you came here.

45:54.400 --> 45:56.390
Don't worry, Young Master Shangjue.

45:56.390 --> 45:58.620
Young Master Yuanzhi didn't disturb my rest.

45:58.620 --> 46:01.030
He just came to check on my injuries.

46:02.990 --> 46:03.900
I didn't say

46:04.260 --> 46:05.520
he was disturbing you.

46:07.370 --> 46:08.240
I didn't say

46:08.610 --> 46:10.410
I was here to check on you either.

46:14.330 --> 46:16.190
Why don't you take your medicine?

46:36.940 --> 46:37.900
Thank you.

47:02.260 --> 47:02.840
Yuanzhi.

47:05.740 --> 47:06.270
Yuanzhi?

47:34.400 --> 47:35.930
Why are you drinking alone?

47:36.380 --> 47:37.580
Wine is not medicine.

47:37.710 --> 47:39.170
Of course I drink it alone.

47:40.370 --> 47:42.830
Should I wait for someone to feed me instead?

47:46.100 --> 47:47.500
You're angry about that?

47:53.980 --> 47:54.690
Young Master.

47:54.690 --> 47:55.950
Young Master Yuanzhi.

47:56.140 --> 47:57.650
News from the base of the valley,

47:57.650 --> 48:00.580
about the thief on the night of the Lantern Festival.

48:15.300 --> 48:16.700
Brother, you were right.

48:17.940 --> 48:20.740
That night, the thief did not steal Yun Weishan's things

48:20.740 --> 48:21.740
by coincidence.

48:22.770 --> 48:24.770
It was indeed to distract Gong Ziyu.

48:25.900 --> 48:27.980
The thief is a habitual offender of Jiuchen Valley.

48:27.980 --> 48:28.980
According to him,

48:29.740 --> 48:31.600
Miss Ziyi instructed him to do so.

48:31.650 --> 48:32.610
Ziyi?

48:33.710 --> 48:36.170
I can't believe Yun Weishan went to meet her.

48:36.380 --> 48:37.840
Did she not find her dirty?

48:38.140 --> 48:39.690
Have you investigated Ziyi?

48:39.690 --> 48:40.260
Yes.

48:40.620 --> 48:42.220
Her original name is Ye Xiao.

48:42.250 --> 48:45.410
Her parents and brother used to be slaves of a wealthy merchant in Jiangnan.

48:45.410 --> 48:48.020
Then, they were sent to the human hunting range.

48:48.020 --> 48:48.950
What's that?

48:49.940 --> 48:51.760
It's a game for the leisure and rich.

48:51.760 --> 48:53.360
They put people in the forest

48:53.460 --> 48:55.160
and hunt them like animals.

48:55.780 --> 48:58.210
Her father and brother died in the hunting range.

48:58.210 --> 49:01.070
So the human trafficker sold her to Wanhua Pavilion

49:01.140 --> 49:02.200
and named her Ziyi.

49:04.980 --> 49:06.580
She is also a pitiful person.

49:07.220 --> 49:08.380
So Yun Weishan

49:08.380 --> 49:09.680
went to see her

49:10.260 --> 49:11.790
because she was jealous?

49:12.170 --> 49:13.330
Of course not.

49:14.010 --> 49:15.670
If she were just jealous,

49:16.420 --> 49:17.790
there was no need to

49:18.440 --> 49:19.530
fake the theft

49:19.620 --> 49:21.140
and distract Gong Ziyu.

49:22.860 --> 49:25.790
Yun Weishan is Gong Ziyu's legitimate wife.

49:26.820 --> 49:28.880
If she wanted to establish her place,

49:29.220 --> 49:30.870
she should have

49:31.580 --> 49:33.300
brought Gong Ziyu with her.

49:37.850 --> 49:39.180
Send two jade guardians

49:39.650 --> 49:41.430
to keep watch in the Wanhua Pavilion.

49:41.430 --> 49:41.880
Yes.

50:11.370 --> 50:11.990
Elder Yue,

50:13.090 --> 50:15.750
what is the content of the Second Realm's trial?

50:15.880 --> 50:16.490
No hurry.

50:16.980 --> 50:18.400
I have a few questions

50:18.880 --> 50:20.360
to ask Miss Yun first.

50:21.710 --> 50:22.290
Ask her?

50:23.160 --> 50:24.450
Shouldn't it be me?

50:25.870 --> 50:26.600
Elder Yue,

50:26.860 --> 50:28.250
if you have any questions,

50:28.250 --> 50:29.180
please go ahead.

50:30.140 --> 50:30.960
The boat has docked.

50:30.200 --> 50:33.560
[Gong residence back hill - Yue residence]

50:31.220 --> 50:32.480
Let's go ashore first.

51:19.340 --> 51:21.360
[Air Frost]

51:36.290 --> 51:40.460
[New Snow]
